      "claim": "Elinzanetant, a lipophilic CF3-containing amide with a morpholine-type amine, had oral bioavailability of 36.7% and is described as orally bioavailable.",
      "card_ids": ["C15", "C17", "C23"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Glasdegib and OTX015, other amide/heteroaryl oral drugs, had F of 77% and good oral bioavailability, respectively.",
      "card_ids": ["C14", "C19", "C18", "C24", "C31"]
    },
