      "claim": "The only sub-20% value in the evidence set is isradipine's 16% non-cirrhotic comparator, but isradipine is a structurally dissimilar dihydropyridine and the context's gold outcome is the cirrhotic 37%; this low-transferability record does not outweigh the relevant high-F analogs.",
      "card_ids": ["C28", "C04", "C09", "C29"]
    }
