  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement exists for the exact query molecule.",
    "No experimental solubility, permeability, or first-pass data are available for the query; the low prior is physicochemical only.",
    "The query's OCF3 and 2,6-dimethylmorpholine-pyridine combination is not exactly covered by any card; closest analogs differ in polar substituents and formulation.",
